# Sabor-app: frontend rules (React + Router + Tailwind)

- Keep React code simple and readable.
- Use existing routing structure in frontend/src/App.js (React Router).
- Prefer new pages in: frontend/src/pages/
- Prefer reusable UI in: frontend/src/components/

Styling:
- Use Tailwind utility classes where possible.
- Reuse existing Tailwind config choices.

API calls:
- Always use relative paths: /api/...
- Do NOT hardcode full backend URLs like http://127.0.0.1:5000 in code.
- If a helper exists (frontend/src/services/api), reuse it instead of writing fetch everywhere.